1
00:00:05,186 --> 00:00:09,186
(Sheldon:)Please, please, please.
Let me meet Hawking.

2
00:00:09,357 --> 00:00:12,317
- l told you no.
- But I said I'm sorry.

3
00:00:12,485 --> 00:00:15,235
(Howard:)No, you said,
"Would it help if I said'I'm sorry'?"

4
00:00:16,447 --> 00:00:18,157
Well, and you never answered me.

5
00:00:18,324 --> 00:00:20,494
(Sheldon:)So who owes whom an apology now?

6
00:00:21,327 --> 00:00:23,287
(Howard:)Sheldon, you're a condescending jerk.

7
00:00:23,454 --> 00:00:26,704
(Howard:)Why on earth would I want
to do something nice for you?

8
00:00:26,875 --> 00:00:28,915
(Sheldon:)To go to Jewish heaven?

9
00:00:30,837 --> 00:00:32,377
(Howard:)Jews don't have heaven.

10
00:00:32,547 --> 00:00:34,377
Well, then, to avoid Jewish hell?

11
00:00:34,549 --> 00:00:36,759
(Howard:)Have you met my mother?
I live in Jewish hell.

12
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:40,970
(Sheldon:)Howard, please.
This is Stephen Hawking.

13
00:00:41,139 --> 00:00:44,179
(Sheldon:)Perhaps my only intellectual equal.

14
00:00:44,684 --> 00:00:46,474
(Howard:)You can't be serious.

15
00:00:46,644 --> 00:00:48,184
Try to put yourseIf in my place.

16
00:00:48,354 --> 00:00:51,104
lmagine you're the sole human being...

17
00:00:51,274 --> 00:00:53,984
(Sheldon:)...living on a planet
populated with nothing but dogs.

18
00:00:54,152 --> 00:01:01,022
(Sheldon:)And then it turns out
there's another human being.

